-- Five more sample clients, all assigned to caregiver Sample Caregiver (company ID C4XXXXX), so the app and the
-- administrator portal can be shown with a fuller caseload. Clinical fields (age, sex, blood pressure and heart
-- disease history, average glucose, BMI, smoking status, residence) come from records 12175, 53882, 2326, 6118 and
-- 712 of the public Kaggle "Stroke Prediction Dataset" (fedesoriano), each with stroke = 1. The dataset is
-- anonymised, so the names, addresses, dates and phone numbers are fictional, and the care plans are general
-- examples for demonstration, not clinical advice. Records already used: 9046, 17308, 43717, 66159.
-- Safe to run twice: patients are only added if not already there, and the assignment skips existing ones.

